  "description": {
   "en": "“Choose. Will you leave this place alone, leaving the child behind… Or will you marry me and stay with the child?”\n\nAfter a fiery night spent with a man who happened to save her life, a night that seemed abnormally intense. A single day’s mistake comes back with a tremendous price.\n\n“I’m pregnant.”\n\nRosena, who had been hiding and raising her child, abandoned everything.\n\nAfter 7 years, the empire she returned to had changed in many ways. But wait, my child’s father is the mad third prince?\n\n---\nSeven years after leaving the Herbet Empire to escape her selfish mother, Rosena Estalot returns seeking treatment for her sick son, Illion. There, she reunites with Yerhan, the third prince of the empire and Illion's father. When Yerhan proposes marriage, Rosena, reluctant to reenter high society and confront her mother again, agrees on one condition: an eventual divorce. With Rosena so set on pushing him away, can Yerhan win her heart before their marriage runs its course?"
  },
